sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Requester
    participant RS as Report Service (pending)
    participant O as Order Service
    participant C as Courier
    participant A as Admin
    participant UI as Admin UI (integration pending)
    participant B as Pub/Sub
    Note over RS,UI: CHANGE-163 approved requirements; Report/UI implementation pending
    R->>RS: Submit report + explanation/evidence (Report validates scope)
    RS->>RS: Persist report identity and creation intent
    RS->>O: Place report-specific hold (requester token)
    O-->>RS: Hold committed
    RS-->>C: Await response; show responseDeadlineAt
    A->>UI: Review report, participants and Order
    alt Admin chooses resolution while still awaiting
      UI-->>A: Warning: courier still has time; resolve anyway?
      A->>UI: Confirm early resolution
      Note over A,UI: Cancel ends the action without mutation
    else Wait for readiness
      alt Courier responds before deadline
        C->>RS: Explanation + evidence
        RS->>RS: Save response + READY_FOR_REVIEW atomically
      else Deadline passes
        RS->>RS: Persist READY_FOR_REVIEW without response
      end
    end
    opt Separate Order decision
      A->>O: Apply penalty or admin cancel with reason
    end
    A->>UI: Supply required admin reply
    UI->>O: Resolve report (stable commandId + reply + admin token)
    O->>O: Commit journal/possible effect; keep hold
    O->>RS: Synchronous resolve without callback, generation1
    RS->>RS: Atomic RESOLVED + private reply/admin/time + operation journal
    RS-->>O: Bound committed APPLIED result
    alt Final Order transaction succeeds
      O->>O: Release only this hold + SUCCEEDED + saved response
      O-->>UI: Success; other holds remain
    else Failed or uncertain before local success
      O->>O: Commit generation2 compensation + outbox; keep hold
      O->>B: Stable compensation event after commit
      B->>RS: Restore/fence exact operation
      RS->>RS: Conditional prior-state restore + original deadline reconciliation
      RS->>B: Durable compensation result
      B->>O: Authenticated result
      O->>O: Inbox dedup + COMPENSATED or reconciliation; hold remains
    end
    Note over RS: No category change approved; no fixed duration selected here
    Note over O: Existing saga is default disabled; real Report/cloud verification pending
